    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. To make this more practical for the trainees, could you drill down into some more concrete visual indicators? For example, are there certain styles of dress, common types of accessories (like hoods or certain types of baggy clothing), or specific 'street' mannerisms that are statistically more correlated with criminal activity or gang affiliation in these types of neighborhoods? We want the officers to know exactly what to look for when they're patrolling.",
